<title>USA: Orbit International Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Orbit International Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended		 Year Ended</p>
<p>		    December 31,		     December 31,</p>
<p>		   1996	   1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p>Sales     $4,403	 $1,737	 $16,971	  $11,763</p>
<p>Earnings from continuing</p>
<p>operations   731	    186	   3,311(a)	2,491(b)</p>
<p>(Loss) from discontinued</p>
<p>operations  (799)	(4,705)	 (8,800)(c)     (24,744)</p>
<p>Net (loss)   (68)	(4,519)	 (5,489)	  (22,253)</p>
<p>Earnings per share from continuing</p>
<p>operations  $ .11     $   .03	  $   .50	  $   .42</p>
<p>(Loss) from discontinued</p>
<p>operations  $ ( .12)   $  ( .80)	$  (1.32)	$ (4.18)</p>
<p>Net (loss)</p>
<p>per share   $ ( .01)   $   (.77)	$   ( .82)     $ (3.76)</p>
<p>Weighted shares:</p>
<p>		 6,769	5,886	     6,688	   5,922</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>(a)  includes approximately $800,000 ($.12 per share) of income representing the final payment of royalty income received from former affiliate.</p>
<p>(b) includes $869,000 ($.15 per share) of income related to insurance proceeds resulting from the death of Company's principal officer net of accrued costs to officer's estate.</p>
<p>(c)  includes the estimated loss of $4,600,000 ($.69 loss per share) resulting from reserves taken on an expected loss on the disposal of its apparel segments.</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Orbit International Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
